            {
                "entry_id": "888a9f5e-1356-30fd-b93c-376e49d275cb",
                "word": "paling",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "003035fd-72ac-4f04-af3b-362a301caad3",
                        "entry_id": "888a9f5e-1356-30fd-b93c-376e49d275cb",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "palings"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7c6e569d-7b25-386d-9102-c363c1b623e6",
                        "entry_id": "888a9f5e-1356-30fd-b93c-376e49d275cb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A pointed stick used to make a fence."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "77630130-b8c4-45b1-9544-eebb65eed2bc",
                                "sense_id": "7c6e569d-7b25-386d-9102-c363c1b623e6",
                                "text": "The boys continued hitting the tennis ball with pailings snatched from a fence […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a38ba397-6dae-4641-8553-794c9f38ab54",
                                "sense_id": "7c6e569d-7b25-386d-9102-c363c1b623e6",
                                "text": "The smell of the damp eucalypt palings that clad the walls exhaling their aromatic resin into the house, mingling with the fragrance of the myrtle burning in the fireplace."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ef134044-6e24-32cf-bc3d-aca940c4a5d9",
                        "entry_id": "888a9f5e-1356-30fd-b93c-376e49d275cb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A fence made of palings."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "79bd76fd-0501-43a2-8f55-4df601608106",
                                "sense_id": "ef134044-6e24-32cf-bc3d-aca940c4a5d9",
                                "text": "1789, Alderman Le Mesurier), addressing the House of Commons, in The Parliamentary Register,ᴴᵃⁿˢᵃʳᵈ London: John Debrett, Volume 26, p. 172,\nGentlemen must have observed that many of the nurserymen’s plantations were wide and extensive, some of them covering several acres; and that their palings and fences were for the most part low, and might be so weak and out of repair, as to afford a very insufficient security against the inroads of robbers and spoilers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9e87cf3d-9ede-4020-b7ff-64e15b0fb5a4",
                                "sense_id": "ef134044-6e24-32cf-bc3d-aca940c4a5d9",
                                "text": "The park paling was still the boundary on one side, and she soon passed one of the gates into the ground."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b5b1a2b-7198-4cc1-a0e1-46ec6cc010e3",
                                "sense_id": "ef134044-6e24-32cf-bc3d-aca940c4a5d9",
                                "text": "The wide doors and windows of the restaurant stood open, beneath large awnings, to a wide pavement, where there were other plants in tubs, and rows of spreading trees, and beyond which there was a large shady square, without any palings, and with marble-paved walks."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6bb36a55-092a-3c4a-b21a-a417fc0f7b33",
                        "entry_id": "888a9f5e-1356-30fd-b93c-376e49d275cb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A fence made of galvanized sheeting."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Caribbean"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "15cf0d3c-243e-4321-9cab-224314a4bf9d",
                                "sense_id": "6bb36a55-092a-3c4a-b21a-a417fc0f7b33",
                                "text": "He worked badly. He had to paint a large sign on a corrugated iron paling. Doing letters on a corrugated surface was bad enough; to paint a cow and a gate, as he had to, was maddening."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6407f242-ba2d-4417-90ee-10c1387082ed",
                        "source_entry_id": "888a9f5e-1356-30fd-b93c-376e49d275cb",
                        "source_sense_description": "stick",
                        "target_lang_word": "pieu",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pieu",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "78f4e536-12e5-33ff-8c42-9ac01e53f460",
                                        "entry_id": "f1ea1345-1cc7-3939-a62c-912567e0fb4f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pièce de bois qui est pointue par un des bouts et qu’on emploie à divers usages."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d2959df-7eed-4a9a-a922-3f922ef3afa1",
                                                "sense_id": "78f4e536-12e5-33ff-8c42-9ac01e53f460",
                                                "text": "Que de crimes, de guerres, de meurtres, que de misères et d’horreurs n’eût point épargnés au genre humain celui qui, arrachant les pieux ou comblant le fossé, eût crié à ses semblables : Gardez-vous d’écouter cet imposteur ; vous êtes perdus, si vous oubliez que les fruits sont à tous, et que la terre n’est à personne !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b79f46d-2c54-4988-8883-70c2ddc71813",
                                                "sense_id": "78f4e536-12e5-33ff-8c42-9ac01e53f460",
                                                "text": "Lorsque, par l’effet de l’enfoncement du pieu, sa tête est parvenue un peu au-dessous du pied de la sonnette, le mouton ne peut plus l’atteindre , et alors on ne peut continuer le battage que par le moyen d’un faux pieu."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c2574eb-11c5-49ab-bc77-a18d573ee4c9",
                                                "sense_id": "78f4e536-12e5-33ff-8c42-9ac01e53f460",
                                                "text": "La résistance d’un pieu ou sa force portante résulte de deux facteurs :\n- l’un étant la résistance du terrain inférieur à la pénétration de la pointe du pieu.\n- l’autre étant constitué par le frottement des terres sur la surface latérale."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "10122068-e9e0-3ebe-b73e-9659b2446f3d",
                                        "entry_id": "f1ea1345-1cc7-3939-a62c-912567e0fb4f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pénis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "pieu",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7d030812-8099-30c9-a6f9-85b51b779658",
                                        "entry_id": "45cfff69-0a33-33f5-b6f8-9e88fc335ea1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff49f9bc-afee-4d35-b445-dc714cdd3572",
                                                "sense_id": "7d030812-8099-30c9-a6f9-85b51b779658",
                                                "text": "Les permissionnaires ne songeaient pas à lambiner ; quant aux retenus, aux privés de vacances, ils pouvaient s’octroyer un modique « rab de pieu »."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bcaba22b-39bc-4658-bd7a-3633efe13e0b",
                                                "sense_id": "7d030812-8099-30c9-a6f9-85b51b779658",
                                                "text": "Kalel saute de son pieu pour cavaler à la lourde."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9f49efb-795e-4f66-813c-2982de1e389b",
                                                "sense_id": "7d030812-8099-30c9-a6f9-85b51b779658",
                                                "text": "Pour rétablir l’entière vérité, cette chambre à l’époque où je la connus, avait un petit radiateur électrique Thermor qui se branchait avant d’aller au pieu."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d641ac1-7029-48c8-9892-0ec4c5e71d83",
                                                "sense_id": "7d030812-8099-30c9-a6f9-85b51b779658",
                                                "text": "Je viens de me blinder le cul sur plus de deux mille bornes avec ces trois toupies farinées à l’encens, alors tout ce que je veux maintenant, c’est un bon pieu !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a2491fb0-8058-49ab-86c1-d1cb992181f0",
                        "source_entry_id": "888a9f5e-1356-30fd-b93c-376e49d275cb",
                        "source_sense_description": "stick",
                        "target_lang_word": "кол",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "кол",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "309e5f93-6176-33ef-a8e7-59590f615071",
                                        "entry_id": "0208f757-9001-3e4e-9220-1a4907b11d67",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "заострённый с одного конца шест"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d74b7816-ef0d-4c85-a399-75d1f9dd5d0e",
                                                "sense_id": "309e5f93-6176-33ef-a8e7-59590f615071",
                                                "text": "Я жив и здоров, хотя сильно похудел и на мне всё висит, как на коле."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0d92cc0-da33-4dbb-bd38-1e8379ae2e4d",
                                                "sense_id": "309e5f93-6176-33ef-a8e7-59590f615071",
                                                "text": "Вот объявляет охоту на вурдалаков и оборотней, заготавливая в лесах множество осиновых кольев, из которых в конце концов построили плетень вокруг огорода с матерчатым пугалом в генеральском мундире."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ccab21ef-04d4-4092-b2ce-263c28e547c9",
                                                "sense_id": "309e5f93-6176-33ef-a8e7-59590f615071",
                                                "text": "Он прожил длинную жизнь, полную вольных трудов и невольных приключений, дважды побывал в Турции во времена переселения абхазцев, дважды начинал жизнь с первого вбитого кола."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "209e5609-0b15-403e-b4de-f800207c191b",
                                                "sense_id": "309e5f93-6176-33ef-a8e7-59590f615071",
                                                "text": "Дворянин Нищин, из усадьбы Огородова, под пряслом родился, на тычинке вырос и теперь на коле верхом изволит русскую землю объезжать!.."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "кол",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "03b76083-3c6a-3a8f-b47c-e7a6e0043386",
                                        "entry_id": "4fa5eb8c-20d5-345f-a46c-ab8f9fbaf595",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "школьн. то же, что единица; низшая отметка в учебных заведениях ряда стран, включая Россию"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00248d1f-5bc8-4545-a285-a0f6dbedd116",
                                                "sense_id": "03b76083-3c6a-3a8f-b47c-e7a6e0043386",
                                                "text": "Подозрение пало на меня, потому что именно в этот день я получил «кол» по немецкому, и, если следовать логике, именно я должен был прийти в ярость и отомстить за унизительную отметку."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d4bdc886-f8d7-4945-8eae-099d60033f03",
